cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SortingAlgorithms
message: Please cite this software as below.
abstract: >-
  An executable, animated and benchmarked atlas of 56 sorting algorithms in nine language editions (Python, C, C++, Java, Go, Rust,
  x86-64 assembly, raw machine code and COBOL), generated from one verified source. Includes real-trace GIF animations, teaching notes,
  a research report and a cross-language speed comparison.
